{"content":[{"c":["MACHIR*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Joseph’s grandson and the firstborn son of Manasseh through his Aramean concubine (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.50.23","r":"Gen.50.23","rawR":"Gen.50.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.50.23","value":"Gen.50.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 50:23"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.14","r":"1Chr.7.14","rawR":"1Chr.7.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.14","value":"1Chr.7.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:14"},"). Machir was the father of Gilead and the founder of the Machirite family (",{"href":"?bref=Num.26.29","r":"Num.26.29","rawR":"Num.26.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.26.29","value":"Num.26.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 26:29"},"). His descendants dispossessed the Amorites living in the land of Gilead east of the Jordan during the days of Moses (",{"href":"?bref=Num.32.39","r":"Num.32.39","rawR":"Num.32.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.32.39","value":"Num.32.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 32:39"},"); later, they were assigned this land along with Bashan for an inheritance (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.3.15","r":"Deut.3.15","rawR":"Deut.3.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.3.15","value":"Deut.3.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 3:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.17.1-3","r":"Josh.17.1-3","rawR":"Josh.17.1-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.17.1-3","value":"Josh.17.1-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 17:1-3"},"). In ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.5.14","r":"Judg.5.14","rawR":"Judg.5.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.5.14","value":"Judg.5.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Judges 5:14"},", the whole tribe of Manasseh is called by this name."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ammiel’s son living at Lo-debar, a town east of the Jordan. Machir provided shelter for Mephibosheth (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.9.4-5","r":"2Sam.9.4-5","rawR":"2Sam.9.4-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.9.4-5","value":"2Sam.9.4-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 9:4-5"},") and later, with Shobi and Barzillai, took care of David’s domestic needs during his flight from Absalom (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.17.27","r":"2Sam.17.27","rawR":"2Sam.17.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.17.27","value":"2Sam.17.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 17:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Machir","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 50:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.50.23","rawQueryValue":"Gen.50.23","sourceRefExact":"Gen.50.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.14","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.14","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.14"},{"anchorText":"Nm 26:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.26.29","rawQueryValue":"Num.26.29","sourceRefExact":"Num.26.29"},{"anchorText":"Nm 32:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.32.39","rawQueryValue":"Num.32.39","sourceRefExact":"Num.32.39"},{"anchorText":"Dt 3:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.3.15","rawQueryValue":"Deut.3.15","sourceRefExact":"Deut.3.15"},{"anchorText":"Jos 17:1-3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.17.1-3","rawQueryValue":"Josh.17.1-3","sourceRefExact":"Josh.17.1-3"},{"anchorText":"Judges 5:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.5.14","rawQueryValue":"Judg.5.14","sourceRefExact":"Judg.5.14"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 9:4-5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.9.4-5","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.9.4-5","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.9.4-5"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 17:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.17.27","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.17.27","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.17.27"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7a5e8720f641b40cc8ffd3a8ab072ce79042804a7ab7f77ebc3f5c3f02cca45a","sourceItemName":"Machir","sourceItemOrder":28,"sourceMember":"Articles/M.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Machir","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Machir*","title":"Machir*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}